# I/O Module of QuangTPS

The I/O module handles all data persistence, file operations, and external communications in the QuangTPS treatment planning system. This module ensures that patient data, images, structures, plans, and calculations can be properly stored, retrieved, imported, and exported.

## DICOM Handling (`/quangtps/io/dicom/`)

Provides comprehensive DICOM standard support for radiotherapy data.

### Key Components:

#### Reader Components
- `DicomReader` (`reader.py`): Core class for reading DICOM files.
  - Handles DICOM parsing and interpretation
  - Supports DICOM directory scanning
  - Processes RT-specific DICOM objects
  - Creates internal representations from DICOM

- `DicomPatientReader` (`patient_reader.py`): Specializes in reading patient information.
  - Extracts patient demographics
  - Processes study and series information
  - Handles DICOM patient modules

- `DicomImageReader` (`image_reader.py`): Specializes in medical images.
  - CT, MR, PET, and other modality support
  - Image orientation and position handling
  - Pixel data interpretation
  - Handles multi-frame and enhanced DICOM

- `DicomStructureReader` (`structure_reader.py`): Focuses on RT Structure Sets.
  - Contour sequence interpretation
  - ROI interpretation and naming
  - Structure set correlation

- `DicomPlanReader` (`plan_reader.py`): Processes RT Plan objects.
  - Beam configuration extraction
  - Prescription information
  - Treatment technique interpretation
  - Setup and reference point handling

- `DicomDoseReader` (`dose_reader.py`): Handles RT Dose objects.
  - 3D dose grid interpretation
  - Dose summation and scaling
  - Dose reference handling

#### Writer Components
- `DicomWriter` (`writer.py`): Core class for writing DICOM files.
  - Handles DICOM data creation
  - Manages UIDs and references
  - Ensures DICOM compliance

- `DicomPatientWriter` (`patient_writer.py`): Creates patient DICOM objects.
  - Generates patient and study modules
  - Ensures demographic consistency

- `DicomStructureWriter` (`structure_writer.py`): Creates RT Structure Set objects.
  - Converts internal contours to DICOM format
  - Generates structure references

- `DicomPlanWriter` (`plan_writer.py`): Creates RT Plan objects.
  - Converts internal plan to DICOM
  - Handles beam configurations
  - Creates control points for IMRT/VMAT

- `DicomDoseWriter` (`dose_writer.py`): Creates RT Dose objects.
  - Converts dose grids to DICOM
  - Handles dose scaling and units
  - Creates dose references

#### Validation Components
- `DicomValidator` (`validator.py`): Validates DICOM data.
  - Checks for DICOM compliance
  - Validates required elements
  - Ensures semantic correctness
  - Reports validation issues

### Functionality:
- Full support for DICOM RT objects (CT, MR, RTSS, RTPLAN, RTDOSE)
- Interoperability with clinical systems
- Validation against DICOM standards
- DICOMDIR support for media exchange
- DICOM networking capabilities (Query/Retrieve, Storage)
- Proper handling of UIDs and references
- Support for DICOM conformance statements

